    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootworld</strong> is an online <strong>extraction</strong> game designed to throw you into a high-risk, high-reward adventure. Enter the dungeon, fight off <strong>monsters and enemy players</strong>, and extract with <strong>rare loot</strong>\u2014if you survive. Work together with friends or go solo, but watch your back\u2014others are hunting for the same treasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t just about fighting\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, <strong>quick decision-making</strong>, and <strong>securing your loot</strong>. Each run is unique, with <strong>procedural dungeons</strong> hiding powerful weapons and <strong>game-changing gear</strong>. Make it to the exit portal, store your valuables in the <strong>Vault</strong>, and prepare for your next deadly run.<br><br>DISCLAIMER:\u00a0The Steam version has no blockchain features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/92212bf577de43dcdd013bab908431e0.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Proximity Voice Chat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press V to meet and strategize with other players, or engage in some friendly trash talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/df4533060adffe4a58fa27b938f1fee4.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Procedural Dungeons:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>monsters and rival players</strong> as you explore dynamic dungeons, filled with <strong>hidden loot and danger</strong> at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management and Vault System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with <strong>valuable treasures</strong> and store them safely in your <strong>Vault</strong> to upgrade your gear.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/5c44cc4474a7501a47608c1616054c3e.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for Survival:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stab, slash, and blast your way through PvPvE battles where only the strongest make it out alive.<br><br>The dungeon awaits. <strong>Enter, loot, and escape\u2014before someone else does.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/21fdcf5528bbf1e292e13f231ea1e833.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootworld</strong> is an online <strong>extraction</strong> game designed to throw you into a high-risk, high-reward adventure. Enter the dungeon, fight off <strong>monsters and enemy players</strong>, and extract with <strong>rare loot</strong>\u2014if you survive. Work together with friends or go solo, but watch your back\u2014others are hunting for the same treasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t just about fighting\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, <strong>quick decision-making</strong>, and <strong>securing your loot</strong>. Each run is unique, with <strong>procedural dungeons</strong> hiding powerful weapons and <strong>game-changing gear</strong>. Make it to the exit portal, store your valuables in the <strong>Vault</strong>, and prepare for your next deadly run.<br><br>DISCLAIMER:\u00a0The Steam version has no blockchain features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/92212bf577de43dcdd013bab908431e0.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Proximity Voice Chat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press V to meet and strategize with other players, or engage in some friendly trash talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/df4533060adffe4a58fa27b938f1fee4.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Procedural Dungeons:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>monsters and rival players</strong> as you explore dynamic dungeons, filled with <strong>hidden loot and danger</strong> at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management and Vault System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with <strong>valuable treasures</strong> and store them safely in your <strong>Vault</strong> to upgrade your gear.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/5c44cc4474a7501a47608c1616054c3e.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for Survival:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stab, slash, and blast your way through PvPvE battles where only the strongest make it out alive.<br><br>The dungeon awaits. <strong>Enter, loot, and escape\u2014before someone else does.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597720/extras/21fdcf5528bbf1e292e13f231ea1e833.avif?t=1743267699\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Lootworld is an online extraction game with roguelike, PvPvE, and looting elements. Enter dangerous dungeons, fight monsters and rival players, and extract with valuable treasures. Team up to strategize, secure powerful gear, and dominate the battlefield\u2014if you can make it out alive.",
